WEBVTT

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:21.390
You left the Wulgaru to deliver 
that information to Earth?

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.980
We meet again!

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.880
Have we met somewhere before?

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.460
Yep, once at the pool!

00:00:27.860 --> 00:00:30.420
Now you've got no choice but to date me!

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:32.860
I am terribly sorry.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:34.350
Stop it, stop it, stop it!

00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:35.180
Please ignore her and continue 
with your explanation.

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.610
Lemme go! Lemme go!

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:40.890
I wanna go out with the cool 
guy who came to our rescue!

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.950
Would this happen to be 
part of Earth culture?

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:39.720
Certainly not!

00:02:15.420 --> 00:02:18.390
"The Hunter and the Hunted"

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:21.660
That is correct.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:24.460
I am the one who gave 
Earth the information

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:26.580
regarding the AHSMB 
units that you pilot.

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:30.410
I am Teoria. This is Daneel.

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:33.590
He has been with me 
since I was on Wulgaru.

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:35.420
S-so you're going steady?!

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:37.050
Please ignore her.

00:02:38.240 --> 00:02:42.280
Daneel has served me since 
my days back in Wulgaru.

00:02:42.280 --> 00:02:46.100
In Wuglaru, I am... How should I put it?

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:49.710
I believe the word you are looking 
for in our language is "noble".

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:55.730
In Wulgaru, she is a poised 
woman of high noble birth.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:58.420
Sh-she's a noblewoman?!

00:02:58.420 --> 00:02:59.700
Shut up and listen!

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:02.800
I have come to see everyone

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:05.490
because I wished to personally tell you

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:07.680
about the Wulgaru and the AHSMB units.

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.710
Huh? The AHSMB?

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:21.990
Wulgaru is a planet located 
in a galaxy far from Earth.

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:27.220
Our species has existed for 
longer than you could imagine,

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:30.670
but on a biological level, we 
have already entered our decline.

00:03:32.080 --> 00:03:36.000
If we did not act, our species 
would begin to decline.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:40.010
We would genetically deteriorate 
until eventually going extinct.

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:42.250
Furthermore, all scientific endeavors to

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:44.310
artificially extend our 
lives ended in failure.

00:03:46.710 --> 00:03:49.750
That is why we began a new experiment.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:03:58.890
For the experiment,

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:01.490
we conducted artificial 
genetic engineering to

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:03.120
encourage our genes to advance

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:05.870
and then released these 
genes across the universe.

00:04:07.370 --> 00:04:10.540
When exposed to different 
planets and environments,

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:13.000
we anticipated that the genes 
would create their own ecosystems.

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:17.860
We believed that some may 
evolve to such lengths

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:21.320
that they could supplement the 
Wulgaru's depleting vitality.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:25.250
In other words, you were 
sowing your species' seeds?

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:27.350
The project was a success.

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:29.640
The genes that we had 
dispersed throughout space

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.330
developed independently of each other.

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:35.450
We are currently harvesting those genes

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:38.790
and using them to extend our own lives.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:42.360
We travel through the Space Passage 
that connects the planets,

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.900
which is how we originally 
dispersed the genes.

00:04:43.900 --> 00:04:47.810
Once we find the evolved species, 
we begin to recover them.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:53.790
We refer to this act as "Hunting".

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:57.960
Hunting...

00:04:57.960 --> 00:05:01.230
Do the Wulgaru view 
Earthlings as prey to hunt?

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:03.860
In order to maintain fishery resources,

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:06.290
we release juvenile fish 
and encourage breeding.

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:07.400
It's the same thing.

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:09.430
So humans are one of the

00:05:09.430 --> 00:05:12.190
races that the Wulgaru 
created just to hunt down?

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:13.700
That is right.

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:17.320
However, there are some 
in Wulgaru who stand

00:05:17.320 --> 00:05:18.920
in opposition to these hunts.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:21.280
My mother was one such person.

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:21.920
What?

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.290
It pained my mother's heart

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:26.760
to see the Wulgaru 
annihilate various races

00:05:26.760 --> 00:05:30.280
and treat them as 
nothing more than food.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:34.120
Even if you were originally 
planted for harvest,

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:36.530
those who have evolved 
possess their own futures

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:38.280
as well as their own lives.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:40.560
We have no right to steal that!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:43.340
Got that right! We aren't food!

00:05:43.340 --> 00:05:44.530
Silence!

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:48.320
I slipped away under 
my mother's bidding.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:51.720
The Wulgaru's next 
target was to be Earth.

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:55.680
I came to warn Earth of the 
impending Wulgaru threat.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.760
Also, I came to inform your people

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:59.880
how to take countermeasures 
against the Wulgaru.

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:02.290
You mean the AHSMB, right?

00:06:02.860 --> 00:06:04.800
I shall take over from here.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:10.350
Earth first encountered Teoria and her

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:13.260
attendant shortly after the MJP's birth.

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:16.410
The MJP was originally a project system

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:20.980
meant to cultivate humans 
fit for space life.

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:23.960
But upon learning of 
the Wulgaru invasion,

00:06:23.960 --> 00:06:26.690
it turned into an organization bent 
on preparing for the upcoming war.

00:06:27.510 --> 00:06:33.840
The MJP was chosen because our 
research on human activity in space

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:35.520
was the most advanced at that time.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:37.910
The project was split into two.

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.330
One part focused on developing weapons

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:42.220
while the other focused 
on raising humans

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:43.790
who could wield those weapons.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:46.870
Developing the AHSMB units 
proved extremely difficult.

00:06:46.870 --> 00:06:48.460
We had to modify alien

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:51.220
science to work well 
with the human body.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:54.510
The technology that made this 
possible was the JURIA-SYSTEM.

00:06:56.450 --> 00:06:58.040
After countless failures,

00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:01.850
we only recently developed units 
that could be used in actual combat.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:05.880
The organization entrusted with 
these units was also the MJP.

00:07:09.380 --> 00:07:13.140
This is roughly when the Wulgaru 
appeared around Jupiter.

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:15.740
We had just barely 
completed them in time.

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:20.020
Currently, these two assist

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:23.800
the MJP by serving as something 
akin to technology consultants.

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:27.060
Naturally, only a select few 
individuals are privy to such information.

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:28.670
However, there is a reason why

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:31.680
we have decided to make an exception 
and divulge this information to you.

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:34.660
We have already showed you the

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.580
footage from when Red 5 
fought a Wulgaru fighter.

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:39.060
Here is what he said:

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:41.920
"This duel was amusing."

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:46.070
"Let us fight again, 
primitive creature!"

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.010
"Primitive creature"?!

00:07:48.010 --> 00:07:50.570
Is that how you guys refer to us?!

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:55.490
It would seem that he has identified 
Red 5's pilot as his target.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:57.280
Me?!

00:07:57.640 --> 00:07:59.180
That isn't all.

00:07:59.180 --> 00:08:01.120
The only ones who fought on par with

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:03.060
the Wulgaru during the Battle of Ceres

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:05.930
were those of you piloting AHSMB units.

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:09.600
There is a possibility that 
the Wulgaru have already

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:11.630
marked each of you as superior prey.

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:14.740
We had expected that something 
like this may happen.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:18.810
After all, the Wulgaru's primary 
goal is to harvest excellent genes.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:21.760
As you already know, 
Earth suffered heavy

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.400
losses during the Battle of Ceres.

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.190
Henceforth, Team Rabbits will 
inevitably play a pivotal

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:29.040
role in an increasing number of battles.

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:33.270
In such events, we will 
incorporate how the Wulgaru

00:08:33.270 --> 00:08:35.740
will target the five 
of you into the plan.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:38.520
In other words, we'll 
serve as your decoys.

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:40.660
That is a distinct possibility.

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:49.960
You must be psychologically 
prepared for whatever comes!

00:08:50.360 --> 00:08:52.880
That is why we decided 
to explain the situation.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:58.010
Earth views you as our trump cards!

00:08:58.360 --> 00:09:01.540
We won't send you on reckless 
missions if we don't have to.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:04.770
There is an emergency! I 
will leave the rest to you.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.000
Sir!

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.130
Do you have any questions?

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:13.170
Ma'am, I heard that you're 
going to expand the AHSMB team.

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.510
How far is that plan in the works?

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:18.680
I can't answer that. Anything else?

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:22.310
When should we expect to get 
sent on another mission?

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:23.700
That's undetermined. Anything else?

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:24.870
Me, me, me!

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:28.050
Master Daneel, what do 
you think of human girls?

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:28.940
Tamaki!

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:31.120
I am incapable of 
answering that question.

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:32.110
What?!

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:35.950
For you see, I have hardly interacted 
with the people of Earth.

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:40.180
That means it's up to me 
to win you over, right?

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:47.060
Um, do the Wulgaru know that you 
and Daneel are here on Earth?

00:09:47.570 --> 00:09:48.880
Most likely.

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:51.110
Then what happened to 
your mother, Teoria?

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:53.820
I don't know.

00:09:55.010 --> 00:09:57.610
I hope that she has 
escaped harm's way...

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:01.270
May I ask something?

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:02.640
Certainly.

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:06.700
Who was the pilot in the video 
that fought against Izuru?

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:08.610
Lady Teoria!

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:10.130
Jiart.

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.230
Jiart?

00:10:12.630 --> 00:10:15.090
Yes, his name is Jiart.

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:20.840
He resembles you a great deal, Teoria.

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:23.720
Is that right?

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:25.660
E-excuse me!

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:29.150
Um, we don't remember our pasts.

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:32.310
So why do I remember you, Teoria?

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:40.340
You and I were once very close.

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:44.910
In fact, you could say 
that we were "friends".

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:54.230
S-so-

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:56.430
We have offered you our technology,

00:10:56.430 --> 00:10:58.670
but we cannot answer questions 
that stray from that topic.

00:10:59.150 --> 00:11:01.850
The amount of information 
Lady Teoria offers depends

00:11:01.850 --> 00:11:04.020
on the scope of her freedom and rights.

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:05.930
I'm sorry.

00:11:05.930 --> 00:11:09.860
When I am allowed to say more, 
let's have a nice long talk.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:12.760
I'll be looking forward to 
when that time comes, Izuru.

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:23.740
So?!

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:27.100
Why, pray tell, is everyone in my room?!

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:29.560
It's not fair if everyone 
always gathers in my room.

00:11:29.560 --> 00:11:31.920
I don't like letting people in my room.

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:34.900
Then everyone is welcome 
to come to my room!

00:11:34.900 --> 00:11:37.480
Isn't your room one huge mess?

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:39.070
How did you know?!

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:40.810
Did you sneak inside?

00:11:40.810 --> 00:11:42.260
I knew without having to go inside!

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:44.350
Suruga, you perv!
 You're totally a peeping Tom!

00:11:42.490 --> 00:11:44.350
Pipe down!

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:47.060
I'm still trying to sort out 
everything they told us.

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:51.330
No wonder Earthlings and the 
Wulgaru look alike, huh?

00:11:51.330 --> 00:11:53.650
We both originated from 
the same gene pool.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:56.330
He called us "primitive creatures"!

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:57.730
That's not even funny!

00:11:58.340 --> 00:12:01.040
The battles will be 
going uphill from here.

00:12:01.510 --> 00:12:04.320
I hope the supplemental AHSMB 
teams are ready in time...

00:12:04.800 --> 00:12:06.140
"Team Rabbits."

00:12:07.470 --> 00:12:11.770
I think I finally get why they 
named us that of all things.

00:12:12.270 --> 00:12:13.410
Rabbits...

00:12:13.410 --> 00:12:16.710
We were literally rabbits 
being used in some experiment!

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:28.670
It's okay if we're rabbits.

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:32.750
But we won't go down without a fight.

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:36.460
What the Wulgaru are doing is wrong!

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:39.710
I can't believe they're hunting 
humans for their own survival!

00:12:39.710 --> 00:12:41.650
We can't lose to people like that!

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:45.280
But that enemy fighter named 
Jiart is after you, Izuru.

00:12:45.630 --> 00:12:47.050
I'll be fine! I can win!

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:49.890
I've gotta live up to the 
expectations of the lady who

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:51.660
has braved such danger just to save us!

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:53.690
That's what it means to be a hero!

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:55.000
Hear, hear!

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:56.770
If I work hard enough,

00:12:56.770 --> 00:12:58.960
I'm sure I can become Master 
Daneel's girlfriend!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.240
Let's do our best!

00:13:00.240 --> 00:13:01.420
Yeah, let's!

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:03.770
Hey, so, Izuru,

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:07.240
what type of girl do you think 
Master Daneel would like?

00:13:05.070 --> 00:13:07.240
What's gotten into him?

00:13:07.240 --> 00:13:08.760
I have a good idea.

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.150
He looked like he was good 
friends with Teoria...

00:13:10.150 --> 00:13:11.430
Hey, are you listening?

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:12.680
Where're ya looking?!

00:13:32.810 --> 00:13:35.000
Great! Now for another three laps!

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:38.690
Why the morning jog...?

00:13:38.690 --> 00:13:41.960
We used to jog every day 
back at the academy!

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:44.820
Our battles are just 
going to get harder.

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:46.660
We've gotta keep up with our training!

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:49.270
Why is he so bubbly after 
what happened yesterday...?

00:13:49.270 --> 00:13:51.550
I hardly got a wink of sleep...

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:53.470
I have low blood pressure 
in the morning.

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:56.420
Overcome that with 
determination and grit!

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:59.000
Gimme a one, two! One, two!

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:01.460
Love comes with trials to overcome!

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:02.880
I love you!

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:04.800
I need you!

00:14:04.800 --> 00:14:05.860
I love...

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:10.350
So how were the results 
to yesterday's exam?

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:11.990
Excellent!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:14.120
Izuru Hitachi's results were 
even better than expected.

00:14:14.650 --> 00:14:16.890
His results have suggested 
as much since the beginning,

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:19.880
but he has been adapting to the 
JURIA-SYSTEM at a surprising rate.

00:14:20.110 --> 00:14:21.600
Supposedly Red 5 ceased

00:14:21.600 --> 00:14:24.470
moving in the middle 
of the Battle of Ceres.

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:25.820
It was wary of the enemy.

00:14:25.820 --> 00:14:28.160
The instinct to preserve 
itself must have kicked in.

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:32.220
His open and honest personality 
may be working in his favor.

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:36.640
Currently, Izuru Hitachi has adapted 
the best to the JURIA-SYSTEM.

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:39.520
Following him would be Tamaki 
Irie and Ataru Suruga.

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:41.480
Toshikazu Asagi and Kei Kugimiya have

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.320
not adapted as well as the other three.

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:46.510
I'm surprised to hear that Tamaki 
and Suruga are doing so well.

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:50.240
It may help that both of them 
are true to their feelings.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.270
Conversely, Asagi and Kei are

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:54.660
highly self-conscious and 
tend to act reserved.

00:14:57.270 --> 00:15:00.280
Age may also play a factor,

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:03.840
although all five are progressing 
faster than we had anticipated.

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:05.090
So it would seem.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:13.870
I love you ♪ I need you, ah ♪

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:19.740
Oh, my beloved prince 
♪ You are mine ♪

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:23.270
Dang, you've been on high 
gear since last night!

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:24.640
You think so?

00:15:24.640 --> 00:15:25.860
I think I'm the same as always.

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:27.610
Yeah, right!

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:31.030
You've been hyped up ever since 
you met that Teoria lady.

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:33.620
That's not true!

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:35.950
Right, right! You've got it wrong.

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:38.000
I'm always like this!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.790
Why is everyone in my room?!

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:42.550
You and Izuru are both hyped up.

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:43.850
They're on the same level...

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:45.850
They said that we're the same!

00:15:45.850 --> 00:15:47.300
We're buddies, Izuru!

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:50.830
Yeah, we're buddies with everyone here.

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:52.470
I'm not like you!

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:04.740
Isn't that the Colorado-class 
battleship Princeton?

00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:08.940
Seriously, this isn't the time to 
be going gaga for a girl, Izuru.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:12.890
That Jiart guy has his 
eyes on you, remember?

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:17.280
Let us fight again, primitive creature!

00:16:19.430 --> 00:16:20.470
Jiart...

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:40.250
That was boring!

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:42.690
Prince Jiart!

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:46.250
Prince Jiart, I have come for you.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:49.110
Lord Dolgana ordered me to 
deliver a message insisting

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:50.780
that you attend the parisada.

00:16:51.300 --> 00:16:53.350
Tell him that I shall 
be there momentarily.

00:16:53.350 --> 00:16:56.260
B-but he said to come immediately.

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:58.930
I do not have anything to report to him.

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:00.200
B-but...!

00:17:02.810 --> 00:17:04.300
Did you fail to hear me?

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:06.830
S-surely you jest!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:08.880
Do you think I am joking?

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:18.060
Prince Jiart, please show mercy!

00:17:18.780 --> 00:17:19.930
Very well.

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:22.310
In that case, I shall 
go to see my brother.

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:37.780
You have done well, Dolgana.

00:17:38.510 --> 00:17:41.220
I am unworthy of such praise!

00:17:43.430 --> 00:17:47.810
This expedition allowed us to 
greatly curb the lamata's forces.

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:50.630
It will make the remaining 
shikaara all the easier.

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:54.950
I merely obeyed the words of the 
oracle and devised the strategy.

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:57.490
If in doing so I have earned 
your approval, King Galkie,

00:17:57.490 --> 00:18:00.640
then nothing could bring me greater joy!

00:18:00.950 --> 00:18:03.510
The rest of you did well 
in the shikaara as well.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:04.850
Your Majesty!

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:07.120
I will gladly take those words to heart!

00:18:07.120 --> 00:18:10.400
If Klein had taken more 
action in the frontlines,

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.780
the final outcome would 
have been even better!

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:14.470
I fulfilled my mission!

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:17.080
It's your own fault if you didn't 
get the results you wanted!

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:18.510
Really, now?

00:18:18.510 --> 00:18:20.640
Your battles are always 
monotonous, without any

00:18:20.640 --> 00:18:22.410
sign of improvement in sight.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:23.200
What was that?!

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:24.740
That is enough!

00:18:24.740 --> 00:18:27.010
The harvest was most bountiful!

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:29.940
Legatus Dolgana,

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:31.480
is it true that there was a

00:18:31.480 --> 00:18:33.870
particularly exceptional 
fighter amongst these lamata?

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:37.680
The news of this finding 
has reached me as well.

00:18:37.680 --> 00:18:39.290
I have heard that Pleguzes Jiart

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:42.900
brought back information 
pertaining to that prey.

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:45.450
Do you know any further 
detail on the matter?

00:18:46.040 --> 00:18:49.180
Really, I wonder what 
that man is thinking!

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:52.040
If he knows something, 
I wish he could hurry up

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:54.320
and share it with the rest of us!

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:56.360
I can't stand that man's attitude...

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:57.740
Is there a problem?

00:18:59.120 --> 00:19:01.950
It sounded as though you 
were talking about me.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:05.230
Hardly! I was merely 
saying that I am eager

00:19:05.230 --> 00:19:08.760
to see the lamata you 
picked out, Pleguzes!

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:13.650
We are all aware of how you are 
a true master of the shikaara!

00:19:13.650 --> 00:19:16.840
Alas, even I miss my target on occasion.

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:20.550
I may stab my allies in the back by 
mistake while on the hunting grounds.

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.880
I am sorry that I was late, Brother.

00:19:25.370 --> 00:19:27.010
I just arrived a moment ago.

00:19:27.450 --> 00:19:31.010
Tell us about this lamata that 
you have taken an interest in.

00:19:31.420 --> 00:19:33.040
I cannot do that.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:33.940
What?!

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:38.650
What is the meaning of this, Jiart?

00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:40.970
That is my lamata.

00:19:40.970 --> 00:19:44.650
I believe it would be best if 
everyone selected their own.

00:19:46.100 --> 00:19:47.490
You're hogging him!

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:52.890
According to my reports, there 
were a total of five units

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:54.430
that put up a good show.

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:55.860
I have nothing to say.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.920
Each may shikaara to his own taste, yes?

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:03.030
After all, there are some who do not 
enjoy working together as a group.

00:20:03.030 --> 00:20:05.600
Y-you're referring to what 
I said the other day!

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:07.480
H-how did you hear about that?!

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:12.650
Very well. Do as you will.

00:20:12.650 --> 00:20:14.000
King Galkie!

00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:16.020
You have my gratitude, Brother.

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:19.470
However, if you refuse 
to tell us anything,

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:23.050
there is a chance that someone 
else may steal your lamata.

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:24.930
Bear that in mind.

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:25.970
But of course.

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:28.220
If he is easily devoured 
by a small fish in the sea,

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:29.460
then he must also be a small fish.

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:33.790
It would simply prove that he 
was not worthy to be my lamata.

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:36.180
But I doubt such concern is necessary.

00:20:36.610 --> 00:20:39.840
My lamata will not prove 
to be an easy kill.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:57.130
Is there anything else 
that you have to say?

00:20:57.130 --> 00:20:59.840
Your Majesty! It is a trifling matter,

00:20:59.840 --> 00:21:02.970
but we have decoded the primitive 
creatures' transmissions.

00:21:03.010 --> 00:21:07.030
Apparently the creatures refer 
to themselves as "Earthlings".

00:21:07.300 --> 00:21:11.230
So they possess enough intelligence to 
give meaning to their existence, huh?

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:12.440
Fascinating!

00:21:12.440 --> 00:21:15.650
In that case, why don't we 
call them Earthlings as well?

00:21:16.270 --> 00:21:19.480
But we have never done something 
like that in the past!

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:21.340
Don't be so rigid!

00:21:21.340 --> 00:21:23.790
It has been ages since we came 
across such wonderful lamata.

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:27.990
We should treat them with 
respect in our interactions.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:35.000
Now then, what will you do to 
entertain me next, Earthlings?

00:21:37.710 --> 00:21:40.930
I apologize for leaving during the 
middle of our meeting yesterday.

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:43.640
Did you receive unfortunate news?

00:21:44.010 --> 00:21:46.410
No, but it was an urgent message.

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:49.330
We have found a Wulgaru craft on Mars.

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:55.950
"Operation: Ares"
